u like this control style.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a story about a frustrated executioner in late 17th century. He felt sick at his job and ran away from the gallows. It aroused a riot of monsters, he had to clean up this cruel mess, and find out the truth about the &quot;Gloomy Oil&quot; of this crazy world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a Retro PS2 style Horror Action-RPG, you will use various skill to survive, beat your enemy and explore forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a solo-make indie game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the Book : The Hangman of Paris by Claude Cueni, and the Paintings of Zdzis\u0142aw Beksi\u0144ski. (But it's a story nothing about any Sanson family)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recommended to use gamepad such as Xbox controler or PS DualShock. <strong>Keyboard players can also use Arrow Keys to control the camera</strong>. If using mouse, please trigger the &quot;Use mouse&quot; option at &quot;Config&quot; menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique art style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special art style makes you immerse into the nightmare of executioner. Half sketch half real rendering a different kind of Baroque times. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949120/extras/80c22d2ce3327ad46a7055e55e944b56.poster.avif?t=1773116453\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949120/extras/