e_item_assets/steam/apps/2949120/extras/a8369ec5860ffe2df680a3699917d659.avif?t=1773116453\" width=520 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item transfer system   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect different items on the road and transfer them into valuable resource, like different kinds of bullets or herbs for example. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949120/extras/4f47ce2bfb5b5cb74955e4f042319faa.poster.avif?t=1773116453\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949120/extras/4f47ce2bfb5b5cb74955e4f042319faa.webm?t=1773116453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949120/extras/4f47ce2bfb5b5cb74955e4f042319faa.mp4?t=1773116453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multi-Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 4 defferent endings. The first time playing takes about 5-10 hours. If you trigger some special endings, it would be much shorter or much longer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949120/extras/efd9951aca378b727ea8f3c7facd8aae.poster.avif?t=1773116453\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949120/extras/efd9951aca378b727ea8f3c7facd8aae.webm?t=1773116453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949120/extras/efd9951aca378b727ea8f3c7facd8aae.mp4?t=1773116453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Before Purchasing, IMPORTANT -----------------------------------------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's Retro Including The Control. You can imagine the control feeling is like Old Resident Evil 4 or Old Silent Hill at PS2. Intentionally back to PS2 feeling. Please TRY THE DEMO before purchasing to make sure you like this control style.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</h2>","developers":["JayO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949120/header.jpg?t=1773116453","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2949120/689143/3f0073d24c61dd728f0adc1fe3f5c198d2d57821/1750952314/dash_av1.mpd?t=1741858156","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2949120/689143/3f0073d24c61dd728f0adc1fe3f5c198d2d57821/1750952314/dash_h264.mpd?t=1741858156","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2949120/689143/3f0073d24c61dd728f0adc1fe3f5c198d2d57821/1750952314/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1741858156","id":257016931,"name":"0_trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257016931/ce15f692e2ae131ab56dad3a8a0500501ced57f1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741858156"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2949120/1436306799/88f3769efedf43686c4309c44da396fbf1f1bb6a/1768196307/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768196890","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2949120/1436306799/88f3769efedf43686c4309c44da396fbf1f1bb6a/1768196307/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768196890","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_t